        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Leapfrog\n- People: Chase Stein\n- Teams: Runaways\n- Organizations: Pride, Gibborim\n- Topics: Marvel Comics\n\nFacts:\n- After the Pride was destroyed by the Gibborim, control of the Leapfrog passed to Chase Stein.\n- Since gaining control of the Leapfrog, Chase Stein and the Runaways have used it as their primary mode of transportation.\n- Chase Stein, also known as Talkback, is a fictional superhero character in Marvel Comics' Runaways.",
